SUMMARY:Wheel & Wine
DESCRIPTION:Ever wanted to try your hand wheel throwing – while enjoying a glass of wine? Wheel & Wine is a single evening workshop designed for fun\, creativity\, and exploring clay! Perfect for both beginners and those with prior wheel throwing experience. Enjoy a relaxed and social evening learning the basics of wheel throwing.\nOpen to beginners and first time students\nAll materials are provided\nNo finished pieces will be taken home – the focus is on fun and skill development\nAGES 21+\nPrice: $50\nTimes: 6:00-8:30 pm\nWorkshop date:\nWednesday\, May 27
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/wheel-wine/
LOCATION:Davis Arts Center\, 1919 F St\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
